        <span class="section-eyebrow">Offline Resilience</span>
        <h2>50,000 fans. One network. Zero lost sales.</h2>
        <p>High-density burst traffic overwhelms stadium Wi-Fi. Cell towers saturate. That's when competitors fail. Teamwork's Store-and-Forward technology keeps every POS terminal fully operational during outages, encrypting transactions locally and auto-syncing when connectivity returns.</p>
        <ul class="feature-bullets">
          <li>Store-and-Forward: full POS functionality during network outages, no lost sales, no data gaps</li>
          <li>Transactions encrypted locally on the device, auto-synced to the cloud back office at reconnect</li>
          <li>No dependence on cloud connectivity for core selling, the halftime rush doesn't wait for Wi-Fi</li>
          <li>Handles large bursts of sales volume. Built for the 15-minute intermission sprint</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

